-- Stage 3 (Years 5-6) two-year program: 960 coming-soon placeholder lessons across five subjects.
-- Mathematics is already in 0013_s3_maths_program.sql and is not repeated here.
-- English: 4 lessons a week, ten four-week units a year (320).
-- Science and Technology, HSIE, PDHPE and Creative Arts: 2 lessons a week, eight five-week units a year (160 each).
-- 40 weeks per year. Placeholders are shared lessons (family_id NULL) flagged coming_soon. Safe to re-run (INSERT OR IGNORE).
-- Build a lesson by replacing its row's data and removing coming_soon (keep the seed_key or add a topic suffix).
